{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 🎬 Notebook 3: Item-Based Collaborative Filtering\n",
    "\n",
    "**Mục tiêu:**\n",
    "- Hiểu ý tưởng: \"Phim giống nhau → rating giống nhau\"\n",
    "- Tính similarity giữa items (phim) thay vì users\n",
    "- So sánh với User-Based CF\n",
    "\n",
    "**Ưu điểm:** Item similarity ổn định hơn user similarity (items ít thay đổi)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Lý thuyết: Item-Based CF\n",
    "\n",
    "```\",
    "Ý tưởng: Nếu User A thích phim X và phim Y giống X,\n",
    "          → A nhiều khả năng cũng thích phim Y\n",
    "\n",
    "Khác User-Based ở chỗ:\n",
    "  User-Based: Tìm users giống A → lấy movies của họ\n",
    "  Item-Based: Tìm movies giống X (A đã thích) → gợi những phim đó\n",
    "\n",
    "Công thức dự đoán:\n",
    "  r̂(u,i) = Σ(sim(i,j) × r(u,j)) / Σ|sim(i,j)|\n",
    "  với j là items mà user u đã rated"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "from surprise import KNNWithMeans, Dataset, Reader, accuracy\n",
    "from surprise.model_selection import cross_validate\n",
    "import warnings\n",
    "warnings.filterwarnings('ignore')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Load data\n",
    "ratings = pd.read_csv('data/processed/ratings_clean.csv')\n",
    "movies  = pd.read_csv('data/processed/movies_clean.csv')\n",
    "\n",
    "reader = Reader(rating_scale=(1, 5))\n",
    "data = Dataset.load_from_df(ratings[['userId', 'movieId', 'rating']], reader)\n",
    "\n",
    "print('✅ Data loaded!')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Train Item-Based CF\n",
    "\n",
    "Chỉ cần đổi `user_based=False` là xong!"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "print('🔧 Đang train Item-Based CF (k=40, cosine)...')\n",
    "\n",
    "model = KNNWithMeans(\n",
    "    k=40,\n",
    "    sim_option={\n",
    "        'name': 'cosine',\n",
    "        'user_based': False    # ← ĐÂY! Item-Based = False\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    verbose=False\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "model.fit(data.build_full_trainset())\n",
    "print('✅ Train xong!')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Cross-validation\n",
    "print('🔄 5-Fold Cross-Validation...')\n",
    "cv_results = cross_validate(\n",
    "    model, data, measures=['RMSE', 'MAE'], cv=5, verbose=True\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "rmse = cv_results['test_rmse'].mean()\n",
    "mae  = cv_results['test_mae'].mean()\n",
    "print(f\"\\n✅ CV RMSE: {rmse:.4f} ± {cv_results['test_rmse'].std():.4f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"✅ CV MAE:  {mae:.4f} ± {cv_results['test_mae'].std():.4f}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Gợi ý cho User cụ thể"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def recommend_item_cf(model, user_id, ratings_df, movies_df, top_n=10):\n",
    "    \"\"\"Gợi phim bằng Item-Based CF.\"\"\"\n",
    "    user_movies = ratings_df[ratings_df['userId'] == user_id]['movieId'].values\n",
    "    all_movies = ratings_df['movieId'].unique()\n",
    "    unseen = [m for m in all_movies if m not in user_movies]\n",
    "\n",
    "    scores = {}\n",
    "    for movie_id in unseen:\n",
    "        pred = model.predict(user_id, movie_id)\n",
    "        scores[movie_id] = pred.est\n",
    "\n",
    "    sorted_scores = sorted(scores.items(), key=lambda x: x[1], reverse=True)\n",
    "    results = []\n",
    "    for mid, score in sorted_scores[:top_n]:\n",
    "        title = movies_df[movies_df['movieId'] == mid]['title'].values\n",
    "        if len(title) > 0:\n",
    "            results.append({'movieId': mid, 'title': title[0], 'score': round(score, 2)})\n",
    "    return results\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# Demo\n",
    "recs = recommend_item_cf(model, user_id=1, ratings_df=ratings, movies_df=movies, top_n=10)\n",
    "print(f'🎬 Top 10 gợi ý cho User 1 (Item-Based CF):')\n",
    "pd.DataFrame(recs)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. So sánh Item-Based vs User-Based"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from surprise.model_selection import train_test_split\n",
    "\n",
    "trainset, testset = train_test_split(data, test_size=0.2, random_state=42)\n",
    "\n",
    "# User-Based\n",
    "user_cf = KNNWithMeans(k=40, sim_option={'name': 'cosine', 'user_based': True}, verbose=False)\n",
    "user_cf.fit(trainset)\n",
    "user_preds = user_cf.test(testset)\n",
    "user_rmse = accuracy.rmse(user_preds, verbose=False)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Item-Based\n",
    "item_cf = KNNWithMeans(k=40, sim_option={'name': 'cosine', 'user_based': False}, verbose=False)\n",
    "item_cf.fit(trainset)\n",
    "item_preds = item_cf.test(testset)\n",
    "item_rmse = accuracy.rmse(item_preds, verbose=False)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'📊 So sánh (K=40, cosine, 80/20 split):')\n",
    "print(f'   User-Based CF: RMSE = {user_rmse:.4f}')\n",
    "print(f'   Item-Based CF: RMSE = {item_rmse:.4f}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Vẽ so sánh\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(6, 4))\n",
    "\n",
    "methods = ['User-Based CF', 'Item-Based CF']\n",
    "rmse_vals = [user_rmse, item_rmse]\n",
    "colors = ['steelblue', 'coral']\n",
    "\n",
    "bars = ax.bar(methods, rmse_vals, color=colors, edgecolor='black')\n",
    "for bar, val in zip(bars, rmse_vals):\n",
    "    ax.text(bar.get_x() + bar.get_width()/2, bar.get_height() + 0.005,\n",
    "            f'{val:.4f}', ha='center', fontsize=12, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "\n",
    "ax.set_ylabel('RMSE')\n",
    "ax.set_title('So sánh User-Based vs Item-Based CF')\n",
    "ax.set_ylim(0, max(rmse_vals) * 1.1)\n",
    "ax.grid(axis='y', alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig('results/charts/03_user_vs_item_cf.png', dpi=150, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Thử nghiệm K"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "k_values = [10, 20, 40, 60, 80]\n",
    "user_rmse_list = []\n",
    "item_rmse_list = []\n",
    "\n",
    "print('K thay đổi | User-Based RMSE | Item-Based RMSE')\n",
    "print('-' * 55)\n",
    "for k in k_values:\n",
    "    ucv = cross_validate(\n",
    "        KNNWithMeans(k=k, sim_option={'name':'cosine','user_based':True}, verbose=False),\n",
    "        data, measures=['RMSE'], cv=3, verbose=False\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    icv = cross_validate(\n",
    "        KNNWithMeans(k=k, sim_option={'name':'cosine','user_based':False}, verbose=False),\n",
    "        data, measures=['RMSE'], cv=3, verbose=False\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    user_rmse_list.append(ucv['test_rmse'].mean())\n",
    "    item_rmse_list.append(icv['test_rmse'].mean())\n",
    "    print(f'  K={k:3d}  |      {ucv[\"test_rmse\"].mean():.4f}       |      {icv[\"test_rmse\"].mean():.4f}')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Vẽ\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(8, 4))\n",
    "plt.plot(k_values, user_rmse_list, marker='o', label='User-Based CF', color='steelblue', linewidth=2)\n",
    "plt.plot(k_values, item_rmse_list, marker='s', label='Item-Based CF', color='coral', linewidth=2)\n",
    "plt.xlabel('K (số neighbors)')\n",
    "plt.ylabel('RMSE')\n",
    "plt.title('RMSE theo K: User-Based vs Item-Based CF')\n",
    "plt.legend()\n",
    "plt.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "plt.savefig('results/charts/03_rmse_vs_k_comparison.png', dpi=150, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. Tổng kết\n",
    "\n",
    "| Phương pháp | RMSE | Ưu điểm | Nhược điểm |\n",
    "|------------|------|---------|------------|\n",
    "| User-Based | ~0.87–0.90 | Tìm được niche interests | Chậm, users thay đổi |\n",
    "| Item-Based | ~0.87–0.90 | Nhanh hơn, ổn định | Thiên về popular items |\n",
    "\n",
    "**Kết luận:** Cả hai cho kết quả tương đương. Item-Based thường được ưa chuộng hơn vì:\n",
    "- Similarity matrix ổn định (phim không thay đổi)\n",
    "- Items ít hơn users → tính toán nhanh hơn"
   ]
  }
 ],
